00:05:22,857 --> 00:05:28,857
It was 1973, and the climate was changing.

2
00:10:45,714 --> 00:10:51,714
The Ice Storm is a drama film directed by Ang Lee.

3
00:16:08,571 --> 00:16:14,571
In the weekend after thanksgiving 1973 the Hood
family is skidding out of control.

4
00:21:31,428 --> 00:21:37,428
Then an ice storm hits, the worst in a century.

5
00:26:54,285 --> 00:27:00,285
Ben Hood, played by Kevin Kline.

6
00:32:17,142 --> 00:32:23,142
Elena Hood, played by Joan Allen.

7
00:37:40,000 --> 00:37:46,000
Janey Carver, played by Sigourney Weaver.

8
00:43:02,857 --> 00:43:08,857
Jim Carver, played by Jamey Sheridan.

9
00:48:25,714 --> 00:48:31,714
Wendy Hood, played by Christina Ricci.

10
00:53:48,571 --> 00:53:54,571
Paul Hood, played by Tobey Maguire.

11
00:59:11,428 --> 00:59:17,428
The Ice Storm is a 1997 American drama film directed by Ang Lee and written by
James Schamus adapting the 1994 novel The Ice Storm by Rick Moody.

12
01:04:34,285 --> 01:04:40,285
During Thanksgiving in 1973, two neighboring suburban families seek escape from
their emotional emptiness through infidelity and self-indulgence.

13
01:09:57,142 --> 01:10:03,142
The film stars Kevin Kline, Joan Allen, Tobey Maguire, Christina Ricci, Elijah Wood,
Katie Holmes, Glenn Fitzgerald, Jamey Sheridan, and Sigourney Weaver.

14
01:15:20,000 --> 01:15:26,000
The film was produced by Fox Searchlight Pictures on a budget of $18 million.

15
01:20:42,857 --> 01:20:48,857
The film premiered on May 12, 1997, at the 1997 Cannes Film Festival, where
Schamus won the Cannes Film Festival Award for Best Screenplay.

16
01:26:05,714 --> 01:26:11,714
Fox Searchlight gave the film a limited theatrical release
in the United States on September 27, 1997.

17
01:31:28,571 --> 01:31:34,571
It grossed $8 million in the U.S., and it grossed $8 million
outside the US for a worldwide total of $16 million.

18
01:36:51,428 --> 01:36:57,428
Among other accolades, Weaver won the BAFTA Award for
Best Actress in a Supporting Role.

19
01:42:14,285 --> 01:42:20,285
The film explores themes of infidelity, based on novel or
book, 1970s, thanksgiving, dysfunctional family.

20
01:47:37,142 --> 01:47:43,142
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
